<translation id="6905469223518185641"><ph name="EXISTING_USER"/> hisobiga allaqachon kirilgan.  Internetni alohida kezish uchun Bravega shaxsiy profilingiz (<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS"/>) orqali kiring.</translation>
<translation id="8133590217245064579">Ekranni ulashish uchun tizim sozlamalarida Browther uchun ekranni yozib olishga ruxsat bering.</translation>
